items ({({"picture","try a number after the picture!",}),({"window","You can only see half out of the window because the wooden shutters are closed","scafolding","You notice a bed perched 10ft off the ground on top of the scafolding..strange!","","","desk","The desk is covered in papers from studying (And passing) all his resits",}),({"telephone","You empty your soul down the porcelain toilet making horrid retching sounds","swimming pool","You strip off and join the others in the warm bubbling pool and relax. Ahhhh","slide","You slide down and realise there's a hole in it and you fall 50ft into the pool",}),0,0,0,({"grouse","A large brown bird that provides employment from Aug 12th for Scots.","haggis","You look at the wee animal and decide it would be lovely with tatties and neeps","bagpipes","a lone piper play 'The road and the miles to Dundee' in the distance.","mountains","Massive craggy mountains encircle the loch and make you pine to go climbing.","loch","The large clear loch sparkles in the sunlight and blinds you for an instance.",}),0,0,0,})
